{
  "$schema_note": "制卡质量 eval 回放基线清单。entry=stream 表示按 chunkSize 切块喂给流式切卡器回放；entry=direct 表示整段内容直接走 parse_and_save 路径（对应生产的错误卡修复/收尾残留入口）。outcome 取值：parse_ok（原文即合法 JSON 对象）/ repair_ok（需 clean_json_string 修复后才可解析）/ error_card（解析失败降级错误卡）。lintCodes 为测试侧确定性 lint 原型的预期命中码。droppedProse 为流收尾被丢弃的纯自然语言残留段数。",
  "delimiter": "<<<ANKI_CARD_JSON_END>>>",
  "cases": [
    {
      "id": "01-missing-delimiter",
      "set": "bad",
      "category": "missing_delimiter",
      "file": "cases/01-missing-delimiter.txt",
      "entry": "stream",
      "chunkSize": 13,
      "description": "模型完全不输出分隔符，3 张卡仅靠换行分隔。brace-depth 主信号应逐张切出。",
      "expected": {
        "cards": [
          { "outcome": "parse_ok", "lintCodes": [] },
          { "outcome": "parse_ok", "lintCodes": [] },
          { "outcome": "parse_ok", "lintCodes": [] }
        ],
        "droppedProse": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "02-glued-json",
      "set": "bad",
      "category": "glued_json",
      "file": "cases/02-glued-json.txt",
      "entry": "stream",
      "chunkSize": 13,
      "description": "两个 JSON 对象无任何空白直接粘连，仅末尾一个分隔符。",
      "expected": {
        "cards": [
          { "outcome": "parse_ok", "lintCodes": [] },
          { "outcome": "parse_ok", "lintCodes": [] }
        ],
        "droppedProse": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "03-trailing-comma",
      "set": "bad",
      "category": "trailing_comma",
      "file": "cases/03-trailing-comma.txt",
      "entry": "stream",
      "chunkSize": 13,
      "description": "对象末尾多一个逗号。clean_json_string 不修复逗号级语法错误，降级错误卡。",
      "expected": {
        "cards": [{ "outcome": "error_card", "lintCodes": [] }],
        "droppedProse": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "04-markdown-fence-direct",
      "set": "bad",
      "category": "markdown_fence",
      "file": "cases/04-markdown-fence-direct.txt",
      "entry": "direct",
      "chunkSize": 0,
      "description": "整段被 ```json 围栏包裹，走 direct 入口（对应生产错误卡修复管线 parse_and_save 直调）。clean_json_string 剥围栏后可解析。",
      "expected": {
        "cards": [{ "outcome": "repair_ok", "lintCodes": [] }],
        "droppedProse": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "05-markdown-fence-stream",
      "set": "bad",
      "category": "markdown_fence",
      "file": "cases/05-markdown-fence-stream.txt",
      "entry": "stream",
      "chunkSize": 13,
      "description": "流式路径下围栏包裹卡片：brace-depth 会切出纯 JSON（parse_ok），但残留的闭合围栏 ``` 会在分隔符切分时成为垃圾段并降级错误卡——已知管线疣，Structured Output 应消除。",
      "expected": {
        "cards": [
          { "outcome": "parse_ok", "lintCodes": [] },
          { "outcome": "error_card", "lintCodes": [] }
        ],
        "droppedProse": 0
      }
    },
    {
